11:02.000000Z"},"reviews":[{"id":5628622,"review":"Great place, recommend to anyone.","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:12.000000Z"},{"id":5638849,"review":"The place is spotless with everything you need. Loved the stay and would definitely recommend it for family and friends with young age cuz it is in the second floor :)","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z"},{"id":5717214,"review":"amazing place and amazing service as always year after year and same level of perfection ","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:22.000000Z"},{"id":5733152,"review":"Amazing place and amazing host. Totally recommend. Very responsive and friendly. Very very smooth check in and check out.","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:25.000000Z"},{"id":5742997,"review":"Wonderful apartment and excellent service from Xuru","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:26.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:26.000000Z"},{"id":5767770,"review":"More than perfect","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:31.000000Z"},{"id":5771757,"review":"Perfect location, very helpful team, definitely i’ll come again next summer.\nThe only negative thing was that the place was very dusty","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:32.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:32.000000Z"},{"id":5772843,"review":"This room is really decent and is super close to the kite surfing spots in Gouna. There’s also a nearby pool, supermarket, and great breakfast and coffee places. It’s totally worth it!","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5797077,"review":"Great as always","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:37.000000Z"},{"id":5824227,"review":"Gute Wohnung im zweiten Stock. Alles tiptop. Schöne Pools. Supermarkt in der Nähe. Sauber.","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z"},{"id":5830758,"review":"The Xuru team is very helpful and responsive, and I really appreciate their support.\nHowever, the unit itself was disappointing — it didn’t meet expectations. There were not enough kitchen tools for daily coffee or cooking, the shutters allow too much sunlight in the morning, the wardrobes are very small and poorly designed, and the living room furniture is not comfortable. Unfortunately, I wouldn’t choose this unit again.","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z"},{"id":5861670,"review":"It was a nice space!","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z"},{"id":5868209,"review":"Prettig verblijf en goede service","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:53.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:53.000000Z"},{"id":5901436,"review":"Gutes preisleistungsverhältnis, schnelle reaktion im Chat, saubere wohnung,ausreichend Handtücher,reibungsloser check in und out  .tolle Lage.alles top","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z"},{"id":5908018,"review":"Good stay","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z"},{"id":5935619,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z"},{"id":6023376,"review":"Positive:\nEverything\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z"},{"id":6024609,"review":"Great location","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z"},{"id":6094606,"review":"Positive:\nPerfekte Lage, kleines Geschäft in der Nähe\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:24.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:24.000000Z"},{"id":6099935,"review":"Positive:\nDie Lage war hervorragend. Sehr nahe zur Kite Station. Die Abendsonne habe ich auf dem Balkon sehr genossen.\n\nNegative:\nDie Küche war etwas spärlich eingerichtet","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:27.000000Z"},{"id":6133358,"review":"Positive:\nThe apartment is spacious, with one bedroom, two bathrooms, and a pleasant terrace next to the kitchen. The layout is practical, check-in was straightforward, and the bed was comfortable, providing a good night’s sleep. The swimming pool is just next door and is a lovely place to relax. There is a very convenient Supermarket and pharmacy close by.\n\nOverall, the apartment has plenty of space and good potential, but improvements to cleanliness, maintenance, kitchen equipment, and guest amenities would make it a much more comfortable place to stay.\n\nNegative:\nCleanliness could be better. The floors had a noticeable layer of sand, which was obvious when walking barefoot, and the bedroom windows had not been cleaned properly. There was also a damp patch on one of the walls. In addition, both the shower and the shampoo dispenser were broken, giving the impression that the apartment would benefit from better maintenance.\n\nThat said, there are several areas that could be improved. Neither bathroom is particularly comfortable due to its small size, and the bedroom offers limited storage space, with only narrow shelves and too few clothes hangers.\n\nThe kitchen is very minimally equipped and lacks several basic items, such as a cutting board, bottle opener, and cleaning supplies. The apartment is also stocked with only the essentials, with no bath mats or extra beach towels.\n\nAlthough the property has a rooftop terrace, we didn’t use it as it felt rather uninviting and didn’t add much to the overall experience.","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:35.000000Z"},{"id":6167775,"review":"thank you for this nice time","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z"},{"id":6169178,"review":"Xuru is definitely my go to when booking in accommodation in gouna, great locations and great value for money","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z"},{"id":6173175,"review":"I would’ve loved for all the cleaning detergent for the washer and all the cleaning equipment available because for a traveler, I don’t usually carry these things because they are usually provided by the location other than that, the service was great, and the host was very responsive and very clear in communication","rental_id":242854,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:42.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:42.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}